## Project Information

**Project Name**: Foodora Catering App

**Project Type**: Tugas Besar Konstruksi Perangkat Lunak

**Course**: Konstruksi Perangkat Lunak

**Institution**: Telkom University Purwokerto

**Study Program**: Rekayasa Perangkat Lunak (Software Engineering)

**Year**: 2026

Foodora Catering App is a web-based catering ordering application developed as part of a Software Construction course project. This application provides features such as user registration, login, forgot password with OTP, vendor listing, menu detail, cart management, checkout, booking date selection, QRIS payment flow, order history, unit testing, performance testing, secure coding practice, and final project documentation.

